  "details": "After blocking a friend without unfriending or reporting them, i quickly unblocked them. They joined a new world, then invited me. I joined the world where they did not appear on the player list in the menu, nor in an udon-based list of players. Additionally I was not able to see nor hear them, while they could see and hear me. Both of us were on orange. I was able to request an invite off of them, where accepting it made me rejoin the same instance and resolved the issue.",
